Changelog: 14-11-2026 00:04:08

Fixed. Choosing a theme shows it. The Theme pill only saved the next theme, which the portal reads when it starts, so
a click looked like it did nothing. The pill now opens a menu of the three themes, the chosen one ticked, and the
portal starts again at once in the theme chosen. While an installation runs it says the theme shows at the next start.

