Changelog: 13-11-2026 21:05:30

Fixed. Installing an app from a checkout looks for this repository again (its apps, tools/stage_app.py and core at
the root), not for a Nexus checkout around it: the repository is standalone (owner, 13-11-2026). The wiki's address
is robertotorino.github.io/bazzite-console/.

Changelog: 13-11-2026 20:18:54

Fixed. Desktop icons knows Fan Control, System Overlay and HDMI CEC Manager: their icons were not added to or removed
from the Desktop with the others. Installing an app from a checkout works in the Nexus checkout the suite is cloned
into (the Nexus tools at its root, the suite in bazzite-console/); the suite no longer carries a copy of the tools.
